===== TRIMMED LOG =====
The full agent log for this run was 16 MB of stream-json. What is kept here is
the stage boundary markers and the terminal result record of each of the ten
agent invocations -- the fields that say how each stage ended, how long it took
and what it cost. The intermediate message payloads are dropped: they are the
rendered prompts and the agents' turn-by-turn output, and the prompts that
matter are already in run/ as prompt-<stage>-attempt-N.md.

Ten invocations: implementer, then three cycles of tester -> documenter ->
verifier. The third verifier escalated.
